<style>
  @page {
    size: A4;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .page {
    width: 794px;
    height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden;
    page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, "DejaVu Sans", "Liberation Sans";
  }
  .page:last-child {
    page-break-after: auto;
  }
</style>

<div class="page">
  <div style="text-align: right; margin-bottom: 20px;">
    <!-- Placeholder for logo/header element -->
  </div>
  <h1 style="text-align: center; font-size: 28pt; margin-top: 50px;">WiscAMP Areas of focus</h1>
  <ul style="list-style-type: disc; padding-left: 20px; line-height: 1.6;">
    <li>What practices can our institutions implement now that will assist in nurturing and retaining STEM students?</li>
    <li>How can we identify and support students demonstrating promise for success in a STEM career?</li>
    <li>How can we facilitate the transfer process from a two-year to a four-year institution?</li>
    <li>How can we encourage and prepare undeclared majors to move into a STEM major?</li>
  </ul>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div style="text-align: right; margin-bottom: 20px;">
    <!-- Placeholder for logo/header element -->
  </div>
  <h1 style="text-align: center; font-size: 28pt; margin-top: 50px;">WiscAMP Award</h1>
  <ul style="list-style-type: disc; padding-left: 20px; line-height: 1.6;">
    <li>First Phase: <span data-field="phase_one_dates">{{ phase_one_dates }}</span></li>
    <li>NSF: <span data-field="phase_one_nsf_amount">{{ phase_one_nsf_amount }}</span> (<span data-field="phase_one_nsf_cost_per_year">{{ phase_one_nsf_cost_per_year }}</span>)</li>
    <li>UW-Madison provided new monies to maintain the full <span data-field="phase_one_uw_madison_amount">{{ phase_one_uw_madison_amount }}</span></li>
    <li>Second Phase: <span data-field="phase_two_dates">{{ phase_two_dates }}</span></li>
    <li>NSF:<span data-field="phase_two_nsf_amount">{{ phase_two_nsf_amount }}</span> (<span data-field="phase_two_nsf_cost_per_year">{{ phase_two_nsf_cost_per_year }}</span>)</li>
    <li>UW-Madison: <span data-field="phase_two_uw_madison_amount">{{ phase_two_uw_madison_amount }}</span> (<span data-field="phase_two_uw_madison_cost_per_year">{{ phase_two_uw_madison_cost_per_year }}</span>)</li>
    <li>UW-System: <span data-field="phase_two_uw_system_amount">{{ phase_two_uw_system_amount }}</span> (<span data-field="phase_two_uw_system_cost_per_year">{{ phase_two_uw_system_cost_per_year }}</span>)</li>
    <li>Potential for renewal if successful</li>
    <li>We are in Phase II of NSF-LSAMP Funding</li>
    <li>There are 4 Phases to the NSF-LSAMP Program</li>
    <ul style="list-style-type: disc; padding-left: 20px;">
      <li>Each phase provides 5 years of funding</li>
      <li>Level of funding reduces in Phase 3 and 4</li>
    </ul>
  </ul>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div style="text-align: right; margin-bottom: 20px;">
    <!-- Placeholder for logo/header element -->
  </div>
  <h1 style="text-align: center; font-size: 28pt; margin-top: 50px;">Small Grants</h1>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div style="text-align: right; margin-bottom: 20px;">
    <!-- Placeholder for logo/header element -->
  </div>
  <h1 style="text-align: center; font-size: 28pt; margin-top: 50px;">Small Grants Program Description</h1>
  <ul style="list-style-type: disc; padding-left: 20px; line-height: 1.6;">
    <li>Support efforts in increasing the number of baccalaureate degrees awarded to underrepresented minority students in STEM fields</li>
    <li>Eligibility is open to any of the <span data-field="alliance_count">{{ alliance_count }}</span></li>
    <li>Simple application
      <ul style="list-style-type: disc; padding-left: 20px;">
        <li>2 - 3 pages</li>
        <li>Budget and Budget Justification</li>
        <li>Submitted electronically</li>
      </ul>
    </li>
  </ul>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div style="text-align: right; margin-bottom: 20px;">
    <!-- Placeholder for logo/header element -->
  </div>
  <h1 style="text-align: center; font-size: 28pt; margin-top: 50px;">Small Grants Program</h1>
  <ul style="list-style-type: disc; padding-left: 20px; line-height: 1.6;">
    <li>Two Rounds of Funding each year
      <ul style="list-style-type: disc; padding-left: 20px;">
        <li>Spring (<span data-field="spring_month">{{ spring_month }}</span>)</li>
        <li>Fall (<span data-field="fall_month">{{ fall_month }}</span>)</li>
      </ul>
    </li>
    <li>Grants are capped at <span data-field="grant_cap_amount">{{ grant_cap_amount }}</span></li>
    <li>Small Grants Review Committee</li>
    <li>Though capped at <span data-field="grant_cap_amount">{{ grant_cap_amount }}</span>, institutions or regions have been very creative</li>
    <li>Matching is not required, though sites have been generous with their in-kind
      <ul style="list-style-type: disc; padding-left: 20px;">
        <li>Matching</li>
        <li>People's time – administrative costs</li>
      </ul>
    </li>
  </ul>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div style="text-align: right; margin-bottom: 20px;">
    <!-- Placeholder for logo/header element -->
  </div>
  <h1 style="text-align: center; font-size: 28pt; margin-top: 50px;">Small Grants Funding</h1>
  <h2 style="font-size: 12pt; margin-top: 30px;">Table 1: Small Grant Summary of Student Support by Grant Year</h2>
  <table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-top: 20px; font-size: 10pt;">
    <thead>
      <tr style="border-bottom: 1px solid black;">
        <th style="padding: 8px; text-align: left;">Year</th>
        <th style="padding: 8px; text-align: right;">Number of Proposals</th>
        <th style="padding: 8px; text-align: right;">Total Award for Stipends</th>
        <th style="padding: 8px; text-align: right;">Number of Students receiving Stipends</th>
        <th style="padding: 8px; text-align: right;">Average Stipend per Student</th>
        <th style="padding: 8px; text-align: right;">Other Student Participant Support</th>
        <th style="padding: 8px; text-align: right;">Total Amount Awarded</th>
        <th style="padding: 8px; text-align: right;">Proportion Participant Support</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      {% for row in grant_summary_data %}
      <tr style="border-bottom: 1px solid #ccc;">
        <td style="padding: 8px;">{{ row.year }}</td>
        <td style="padding: 8px; text-align: right;">{{ row.number_of_proposals }}</td>
        <td style="padding: 8px; text-align: right;">{{ row.total_award_for_stipends }}</td>
        <td style="padding: 8px; text-align: right;">{{ row.number_of_students }}</td>
        <td style="padding: 8px; text-align: right;">{{ row.average_stipend }}</td>
        <td style="padding: 8px; text-align: right;">{{ row.other_student_support }}</td>
        <td style="padding: 8px; text-align: right;">{{ row.total_amount_awarded }}</td>
        <td style="padding: 8px; text-align: right;">{{ row.proportion_participant_support }}</td>
      </tr>
      {% endfor %}
      <tr style="border-top: 2px solid black; font-weight: bold;">
        <td style="padding: 8px;">Total</td>
        <td style="padding: 8px; text-align: right;">{{ grant_summary_data.total_proposals }}</td>
        <td style="padding: 8px; text-align: right;">{{ grant_summary_data.total_award }}</td>
        <td style="padding: 8px; text-align: right;">{{ grant_summary_data.total_students }}</td>
        <td style="padding: 8px; text-align: right;">{{ grant_summary_data.total_average_stipend }}</td>
        <td style="padding: 8px; text-align: right;">{{ grant_summary_data.total_other_support }}</td>
        <td style="padding: 8px; text-align: right;">{{ grant_summary_data.total_amount_awarded_final }}</td>
        <td style="padding: 8px; text-align: right;">{{ grant_summary_data.total_proportion_support }}</td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div style="text-align: right; margin-bottom: 20px;">
